{"architectures":["x64"],"id":"HulubuluSoftware.AdvancedRenamer","latestVersion":"4.28","media":{"icons":[{"mimeType":"image/png","path":"media/icon.1fc2130f.png","priority":1,"sha256":"1fc2130f2b011fb30ea17f7af1420faae08185e517506cc9cdd3741aaa6606d4","source":"winget-legacy"}],"screenshots":[]},"package":{"description":"Batch file renaming utility for Windows and Mac.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/license","locale":"en-US","localizations":{"en-US":{"description":"Batch file renaming utility for Windows and Mac.","license":"Proprietary","licenseUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/license","locale":"en-US","longDescription":"Advanced Renamer is a program for renaming multiple files and folders at once. By configuring renaming methods the names can be manipulated in various ways.\nIt is easy to set up a batch rename using multiple methods on a large amount of files. The 13 different methods enables you to change the names, and timestamps of files in one go. The files can also be copied or moved to new locations based on information in the files.\nWith Advanced Renamer you can construct new file names by adding, removing, replacing, changing case, or giving the file a brand new name based on known information about the file.\nBefore performing the operations on the files you can verify that the output will be correct and if you perform the rename and regret it, you can undo the complete batch.","moniker":"advancedrenamer","name":"Advanced Renamer","packageUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/download","publisher":"Hulubulu Software","publisherUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/whatsnew_v4","tags":["file","folder","rename","renamer","renaming"]},"zh-CN":{"description":"适用于 Windows 和 Mac 的批量文件重命名工具。","license":"专有软件","locale":"zh-CN","longDescription":"Advanced Renamer 是一款一次性重命名多个文件和文件夹的程序。通过配置重命名方法，可以对名称进行各种操作。\n你可以使用多种方法对大量文件进行批量重命名，可以通过 13 种不同的方式一次性更改文件名和时间戳，也可以根据文件中的信息将文件复制或移动到新的位置。\n有了 Advanced Renamer，你可以根据文件的已知信息，通过添加、删除、替换、更改大小写或赋予文件一个全新的名称来创建新的文件名。\n在对文件执行操作前，你可以验证输出结果是否正确，如果执行重命名后感到后悔，还可以撤销整个批处理。","name":"Advanced Renamer","publisher":"Hulubulu Software","tags":["文件","文件夹","更名","更名器","重命名"]}},"longDescription":"Advanced Renamer is a program for renaming multiple files and folders at once. By configuring renaming methods the names can be manipulated in various ways.\nIt is easy to set up a batch rename using multiple methods on a large amount of files. The 13 different methods enables you to change the names, and timestamps of files in one go. The files can also be copied or moved to new locations based on information in the files.\nWith Advanced Renamer you can construct new file names by adding, removing, replacing, changing case, or giving the file a brand new name based on known information about the file.\nBefore performing the operations on the files you can verify that the output will be correct and if you perform the rename and regret it, you can undo the complete batch.","moniker":"advancedrenamer","name":"Advanced Renamer","packageUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/download","publisher":"Hulubulu Software","publisherUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/","releaseNotesUrl":"https://www.advancedrenamer.com/whatsnew_v4","tags":["file","folder","rename","renamer","renaming"]},"schemaVersion":1,"source":"winget","versions":[{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.28/app.json","detailSha256":"db30975c0c7565889ccd0cc6f9138675cc56b36875d0336a746de25c87cee8b5","releaseDate":"2026-10-27","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.28"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.27/app.json","detailSha256":"8702e7cf94b813518cdc179cdcf47d4df7795caf4e3741fdd7113c2f21ac42e5","releaseDate":"2026-10-04","releaseDateSource":"manifest","version":"4.27"},{"architectures":["x64"],"detailPath":"versions/4.26/app.json","detailSha256":"765c83e2f3b742ca0c7374b059eedfae7d889b800612dfbac3b25a5b47b422ea","releaseDate":"2